/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (The\040stationary\040bootstrap)
/Author (Dimitris\040N\056\040Politis\054\040Joseph\040P\056\040Romano)
/Subject (This\040article\040introduces\040a\040resampling\040procedure\040called\040the\040stationary\040bootstrap\040as\040a\040means\040of\040calculating\040standard\040errors\040of\040estimators\040and\040constructing\040confidence\040regions\040for\040parameters\040based\040on\040weakly\040dependent\040stationary\040observations\056\040Previously\054\040a\040technique\040based\040on\040resampling\040blocks\040of\040consecutive\040observations\040was\040introduced\040to\040construct\040confidence\040intervals\040for\040a\040parameter\040of\040the\040m\055dimensional\040joint\040distribution\040of\040m\040consecutive\040observations\054\040where\040m\040is\040fixed\056\040This\040procedure\040has\040been\040generalized\040by\040constructing\040a\040\215blocks\040of\040blocks\216\040resampling\040scheme\040that\040yields\040asymptotically\040valid\040procedures\040even\040for\040a\040multivariate\040parameter\040of\040the\040whole\040\050i\056e\056\054\040infinite\055dimensional\051\040joint\040distribution\040of\040the\040stationary\040sequence\040of\040observations\056\040These\040methods\040share\040the\040construction\040of\040resampling\040blocks\040of\040observations\040to\040form\040a\040pseudo\055time\040series\054\040so\040that\040the\040statistic\040of\040interest\040may\040be\040recalculated\040based\040on\040the\040resampled\040data\040set\056\040But\040in\040the\040context\040of\040applying\040this\040method\040to\040stationary\040data\054\040it\040is\040natural\056\056\056)
/Keywords (01\040Dec\0401994\054\040Journal\040of\040the\040American\040Statistical\040Association\054\040Stationary\040sequence\054\040Jackknife\040resampling\054\040Resampling\054\040Stationary\040process\054\040Joint\040probability\040distribution\054\040Purdue\040University\054\040Stanford\040University)
>>
